{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-horse-ear","title":"《恪别传》恪献马残耳答范慎、答太子马矢之嘲","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-dfa94f5fef716a7bbeab","label":"裴注·恪别传","text":"恪献权马先其耳；范慎嘲残耳伤仁，恪答穿耳附珠何伤于仁；太子嘲恪可食马矢，恪愿太子食鸡卵，权问故，恪答所出同耳，权大笑","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"献马并答范慎、太子之嘲","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"受献马并问、大笑","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0086","role":"嘲恪残马耳","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0025","role":"嘲恪食马矢（太子）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052","source_order":[64,28,0],"order":10929}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0086","name":"范慎","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0041","name":"诸葛恪","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0025","name":"孙登","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-e8c408211dc6ad158d52","layer":"pei","quote":"恪尝献权马，先 其耳。范慎时在坐，嘲恪曰：‘马虽（大）〔六〕畜，禀气于天；今残其耳，岂不伤仁？’恪答曰：‘母之于女，恩爱至矣；穿耳附珠，何伤于仁？’太子尝嘲恪：‘诸葛元逊可食马矢。’恪曰：‘愿太子食鸡卵。’权曰：‘人令卿食马矢，卿使人食鸡卵：何也？’恪曰：‘所出同耳。’权大笑。”","attribution":"裴注·恪别传","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-12b3579a9c9a4da79693","start":219,"end":359}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
